        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>ABH L0147 Extra Heavy Door Pivot Set</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese 3/4\" offset pivots are engineered for durability on extra heavy doors including lead lined doors weighing up to 1000 pounds. Set includes top pivot and bottom pivots with installation hardware. Available in 8 different finish colors. <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=519415\"><b>ABH Door Pivots</b></a> are Made in the USA to insure high quality. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor tall or heavy doors use <a href=\"/products/extra-heavy-door-3-4-inch-offset-intermediate-pivot-abh-l019\"><b>ABH L019 Intermediate Offset Pivot</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ABH-L0147_size.gif?v=1704354778\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ABH L0147 Extra Heavy Door Pivot Set Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for ABH L0147 Extra Heavy Door Pivot Set\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Offset: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Weight: Up to 1000 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Door Size: Up to 3'6\" x 7'0\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Door Size: Up to 4'0\" x 8'0\"</li>\r\n<li>US32D model UL listed for use on 3 hour fire doors</li>\r\n<li>BHMA/ANSI C07162/3530A (modified)</li>\r\n<li><b>Handed - Must specify left hand door or right hand door when ordering</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/L0147-install.pdf?v=1691093122\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH L0147 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/L0147-template.pdf?v=1691093122\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH L0147 Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this pivot hinge: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>",
